From 55670f7bd1e75e04c3eb1829d64ef6e7216b0f3c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: "erik.hauan" <erik.hauan@radiantvs.com>
Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 17:01:42 -0800
Subject: [PATCH] proxy: slot-aware routing, affinity, JIT, residency behind
 P1-P9

Behaviour (unchanged from pre-step develop unless noted): residency-filtered
candidates with 503 for an advertised but not-loaded model and model lookups
(/api/show) bypassing the filter; slot-aware reservation (free slot, queue per
slot, GPU pressure plus reservations, local node, scheduler order) with
durable inflight, per-model pending and snapshot completions; session affinity
(hit/miss/rebind/yield) with the RequestEvent and log field; JIT claims and
not-loaded suppression with the one-shot notloaded-retry; per-attempt
re-scoring on failover; early claim release after the response copy (#17);
/v1/models context_length; /v1/responses mid-history normalisation after
bufferBodyAndModel. vLLM gating and served-name residency (step 4) are kept in
local/capacity.

New: NVIDIA #144's cooldown composes as the outer stable partition over the
slot-aware order (routing.Better's first key): a cooling node never outranks a
non-cooling one, even with free slots; all-cooling falls back to slots; a
cooling affinity-bound node is rebound while a warm candidate exists. The P5
filter runs after NVIDIA's resolveCandidates (and demoteCooling) and keeps its
order.

Seams used: P1 main.go (proxy.local = newLocalState(nil)); P2 facade.go
(observeNodes); P3 Proxy.local; P4 rewriteBody; P5 filterCandidates after both
resolveCandidates calls, localNotLoadedRejection, candidate.local; P6
request/localReserve (handleHTTP, takeHeld), reserveCandidate,
releaseReservation, moveReservation and setPriorityLocked hooks, the embedded
reservation.localClaim, RequestEvent.Affinity, releaseEarly; P7 pick,
resetTried, onMove, attempt logs; P8 annotateModel; P9 notLoaded in
ModifyResponse. Each marked // fork:Pn. Bodies in local_proxy.go,
local_capacity.go and the packages local/{affinity,capacity,routing,respnorm}
(routing.Candidate lands here). A nil Proxy.local (NewProxy's default) runs
NVIDIA's code path unchanged. Fork tests move to local_*_test.go and the
package tests; their assertions are unchanged, only setup (withLocal) and
renamed symbols.

Proving tests: TestP1_Nil..TestP9_Nil, TestLocalCoolingIsOuterPartitionOverSlots,
TestLocalAllCoolingFallsBackToSlots, TestLocalAffinityLeavesCoolingBoundNode,
TestLocalFilterKeepsCoolingOrder, TestBetterCoolingIsOuterPartition, TestChar*,
TestHandleHTTP_ModelLookupIgnoresResidency, TestReserveCandidate_IdleTiePrefersLocal,
TestReserveCandidate_FullLocalYieldsToFreeRemote (nvpair-proxy).

Feature-group commit for catch-up step 5, exported as
local/patches/007-proxy-seams.patch.

